      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e1",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "Previous studies have examined the diagnostic and prognostic performance of the aforementioned scoring systems in sepsis patients. The proportion of DIC in sepsis when applying ISTH-DIC criteria ranged from 16% to 45% [18, 19], while the proportion based on JAAM-- DIC criteria ranged from 29% to 91% [20, 21]. Based on the SIC criteria, the proportion of coagulopathy in sepsis patients ranged from 22% to 86% [19, 22]. Similar variability in mortality rate and predictive performance of outcomes have been observed. However, pooled estimate of the proportion of positive scores, mortality rate, and predictive performance of these scores, by making use of meta-analysis in sepsis patients is lacking.",
      "reason": "Describes current knowledge on variability in DIC diagnostic criteria performance and identifies the lack of pooled estimates as an important uncertainty."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "However, pooled estimate of the proportion of positive scores, mortality rate, and predictive performance of these scores, by making use of meta-analysis in sepsis patients is lacking.",
      "reason": "Explains the need for the review to provide pooled estimates, highlighting the importance of conducting the meta-analysis."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e3",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No evidence of similar systematic reviews mentioned; the review addresses a gap without citing previous reviews, so the conditional requirement does not apply."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e4",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The review is not of intervention effects; it focuses on diagnostic criteria for DIC in sepsis patients, so the conditional requirement does not apply."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e5",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The review does not involve complex interventions or delivery contexts; it assesses diagnostic scoring systems, so the conditional requirement does not apply."
